Spade is a spell card given by [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Lancer Lancer].

It was first released in '''Beta 30.0''', costing 3G to cast, and dealt 3 DMG to a random enemy monster. However, if it killed an enemy monster, it added itself back to your hand, allowing you to, with the right conditions, cast it infinitely throughout a match. However, in '''Beta 56.0''', its cost was increased by 2, up to 5, and its effect was changed. It still dealt 3 DMG, but now it allowed you to choose which enemy monster it dealt DMG to, and upon killing a monster, it essentially recast itself, dealing 3 DMG to a random other enemy monster. This recast effect could only trigger once, however, unlike [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Piranhas Piranhas]'.

